The issue arises in the `register_user` method of the `SocialShare` class. Although the registration functionality works as expected, the application currently lacks any mechanism to check for existing usernames before allowing a new registration. Therefore, even when trying to register a user with a username that already exists, the application doesn't react with an error message.

